">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div class="feature-list" data-gsap-scroll="fade-late"><div class="feature-item"><div class="list-dot"></div><div class="text-medium strong">Clear ownership and decision strategic paths</div></div><div class="feature-item"><div class="list-dot"></div><div class="text-medium strong">Hiring and role structures</div></div><div class="feature-item"><div class="list-dot"></div><div class="text-medium strong">Language teams can actually repeat</div></div></div></div><div class="feature-media" data-gsap-scroll="fade" data-parallax="strong" id="w-node-ca08c629-b89e-f33b-def5-ec67b31614b6-510adf70"><img alt="Close-up of a person with curly hair resting their head on their hand with eyes slightly closed and lips puckered against a purple background." class="media-fill" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201.webp" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201-p-2000.webp 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201-p-2600.webp 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201-p-3200.webp 3200w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69c6816d1153ec6c5bf3e1fe_Relaxed%20Portrait%201.webp 3277w"/></div></div></div></div></section>