 frameworks.</li><li>Present findings and recommendations directly to client leadership.</li></ul></div></div><div class="stack gap-07" data-gsap-scroll="stagger"><h2 class="heading-h4">Requirements</h2><div class="w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>5+ years in data strategy, analytics, or consulting.</li><li>Strong background in risk modeling, forecasting, or BI tools.</li><li>Ability to communicate complex insights in simple terms.</li><li>Consulting experience (preferred, not mandatory).</li><li>Fluent English</li></ul></div></div><div class="stack gap-07" data-gsap-scroll="stagger"><h2 class="heading-h4">Benefits</h2><div class="w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>Competitive salary + performance bonus.</li><li>Hybrid work setup (Berlin HQ + remote flexibility).</li><li>Professional development budget (€2k/year).</li><li>Regular team offsites across Europe.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><section class="section cta"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="w-layout-vflex cta-content"><div class="w-layout-vflex text center narrow" data-gsap-scroll="text"><h2 class="heading-h2">For teams preparing for <em>growth</em>, not hype</h2></div><div class="w-layout-vflex buttons" data-gsap-scroll="fade"><a class="button-primary animated w-inline-block" href="https://108.supply/website/people-work?utm_source=people-work&amp;utm_medium=template&amp;utm_campaign=get-template" target="_blank"><div class="button-label" data-figma-id="12018:4671">Get Template</div><div class="button-rail"><div class="button-circle small accent"><div class="icon small w-embed"><svg fill="none" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
