 on risk mapping and KPI frameworks.</li><li>Present findings and recommendations directly to client leadership.</li></ul></div></div><div class="stack gap-07" data-gsap-scroll="stagger"><h2 class="heading-h4">Requirements</h2><div class="w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>5+ years in data strategy, analytics, or consulting.</li><li>Strong background in risk modeling, forecasting, or BI tools.</li><li>Ability to communicate complex insights in simple terms.</li><li>Consulting experience (preferred, not mandatory).</li><li>Fluent English</li></ul></div></div><div class="stack gap-07" data-gsap-scroll="stagger"><h2 class="heading-h4">Benefits</h2><div class="w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>Competitive salary + performance bonus.</li><li>Hybrid work setup (Berlin HQ + remote flexibility).</li><li>Professional development budget (€2k/year).</li><li>Regular team offsites across Europe.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section outreach-seo" data-seo="jobs-malta-europe"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="w-layout-vflex section-content"><div class="w-layout-vflex text center narrow"><h2 class="heading-h3">Apply for this role with Outreach Recruitment</h2><p class="text-medium">This opportunity is part of our jobs in Europe network for EU candidates. If the role fits your experience, send your CV and our recruitment team will guide the next steps.</p></div><div class="w-layout-vflex buttons"><a class="button-primary animated w-inline-block" href="/jobs/people-connector-apply"><div class="button-label">Apply now</div><div class="button-rail"><div class="button-circle small accent"><div class="icon small w-embed"><svg fill="none" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12H19M19 12L13 6M19 12L13 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div></div></div></a><a class="button-secondary w-inline-block" href="/careers"><div class=