-</svg></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="navigation-overlay"></div></div><main class="main"><section class="section page-header"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="w-layout-vflex section-content"><div class="w-layout-vflex text center narrow" data-gsap-scroll="text"><h1 class="heading-h1">Licenses</h1><div class="text-medium">All graphical assets in this template are licensed for personal and commercial use. If you'd like to use a specific asset, please check the license below.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section padding-top-extra-small"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container sticky w-container"><div class="w-layout-vflex section-content"><div class="sidebar-layout" data-pin-wrap="true"><div class="sidebar sticky" data-gsap-scroll="fade" id="w-node-_3e3c1105-280a-78d1-39de-36fd39a4d0e6-3c0ea9e1"><div class="anchor-nav"><a class="anchor-nav-item w-inline-block" href="#media"><div class="text-medium">01</div><div class="text-medium">Media</div></a><a class="anchor-nav-item w-inline-block" href="#fonts"><div class="text-medium">02</div><div class="text-medium">Fonts</div></a><a class="anchor-nav-item w-inline-block" href="#icons"><div class="text-medium">03</div><div class="text-medium">Icons</div></a></div></div><div class="sidebar-slides" data-gsap-scroll="stagger"><div class="sidebar-slide"><div class="heading-h6">We’re genuinely grateful for the incredible ecosystem of creators around the world who choose to share their work openly. Because of that, we’re able to build templates that feel thoughtful, complete, and alive. This project wouldn’t exist without that generosity and we don’t take it for granted.</div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex sidebar-slide" id="media"><div class="stack gap-06" id="data"><h2 class="heading-h5">Media</h2><div class="text-medium">All visuals used across this project are carefully selected from open-source platforms such as <a href="https://pexels.com" target="_blank">Pexels</a>, <a href="https://Lummi.ai," target="_blank">Lummi.ai</a>, and occasionally <a href="https://unsplash.com" target="_blank">Unsplash</a>.<br/>We don’t treat visuals as filler. Every image and video is chosen intentionally to match the tone, category, and purpose of the template — so you can actually use them in real-world projects, not just demos. <br/><br/>All assets are free for both personal and commercial use, with no attribution required. We’re incredibly thankful to the creators who share their work openly. We truly love the visuals we use — and we choose them with care.</div></div><div class="grid"><div class="image-3-2"><img alt="Smiling man with curly dark hair, beard, and glasses wearing a beige ribbed polo shirt in front of a blue curtain." class="media-fill" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69aa8c70fe733426793ff520_Smiling%20Bearded%20Man.webp" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69aa8c70fe733426793ff520_Smiling%20Bearded%20Man-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69aa8c70fe733426793ff520_Smiling%20Bearded%20Man-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69aa8c70fe733426793ff520_Smiling%20Bearded%20Man-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69aa8c70fe733426793ff520_Smiling%20Bearded%20Man-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69aa8c70fe733426793ff520_Smiling%20Bearded%20Man-p-2000.webp 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4f/69aa8c70fe733426793ff520_Smiling%20Bearded%20Man.webp 2400w"/></div><div class="image-3-2"><img alt="Hands of diverse skin tones stacked together symbolizing unity and teamwork." class="media-fill" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6996b31b0e199fa8510adf4